Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:49.28,Hook,,0,0,0,,HACIENDO PESAS EN GTA\N6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ah, tengo que ejercitar\Npara mantener el cuerpo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.82,0:00:02.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}porque si no,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.56,0:00:06.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}me pongo todo flaco y\Nescuálido. ¡Es verdad!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:08.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Oye, casi no la saco, wey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.54,0:00:11.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Casi que no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:12.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me hago daño.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.44,0:00:13.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Cómo lo bajo así,\Nsuavecito?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.74,0:00:16.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ah, la estoy sudando, wey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.66,0:00:18.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Oye, wey, wey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.38,0:00:19.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Todavía me falta un poco,\N¡esperen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:21.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Esta no la termino, eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:23.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Esta no la termino.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:25.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Nunca logro terminar\Nestas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.74,0:00:27.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No, no la termino.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:31.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No, no la hice, wey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:32.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ya…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.67,0:00:34.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}…casi lo lleno.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.55,0:00:36.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Últimas!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.23,0:00:37.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Listo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:41.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Proteína completa. Ahora a\Ndescansar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.88,0:00:42.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}a recuperarse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:45.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.44,0:00:47.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Por qué no puedo correr?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.12,0:00:49.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Me voy a desmayar o qué?
